<back><div type="tailChords"><p>E♭ E♭/G A♭ B♭ Fm B♭7 E♭ A♭/E♭ E♭ E♭/G Fm/A♭ Fm E♭/B♭ B♭7 E♭ A♭/E♭ E♭</p></div>
<div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through the streets of the city in the darkness of the night,</l><l>Far from the fold, He heard my lonely cry.</l><l>Now I sit at His table in the palace of light;</l><l>His sheep am I.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
